		(uuid "124c3c7f-9a51-4020-a34f-707c906975e8")
	)
	(text "Voltage drop across the \nsense resistor (RSNS) for a \nlinear response is 2V max. \nStarts to clip at 2.49V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.402 94.234 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1341c630-a96a-4e7f-ac5a-6bda6ef404f9")
	)
	(text "R2\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.364 46.736 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1b648af4-8e22-4991-b50d-8ff5c3e708a1")
	)
	(text "Overall:\n\n- Supports VDD = 5V or 3V3\n	- AMC1311B high-side voltage isolation with differential output\n	- ADuM5010 provides isolated 3V3 supply from 3V3 or 5V input\n- Differential output is filtered and converted to single-ended by TLV9001 op amp (U15)\n	- Output is centered around mid-supply (VDD/2) for ADC compatibility\n	- Second TLV9001 op amp (U14) buffers VDD/2 as the VREF mid-point\n- Input voltage appears as 0…2V across RSNS\n	- Bus voltage is scaled by top leg of 6 unit resistors RX before RSNS on bottom leg\n	- Design maintains <100 µA divider current and ≤75V across each RX resistor\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.18 174.498 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2a59a533-ba66-47b3-960d-d908176381f7")
	)
	(text "2V\n.\n.\n.\n0V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 81.026 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
				(color 72 72 72 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2bbf6283-34ca-48c5-8a3d-3c01f5da2586")
	)
	(text "3.30V[5.0V]\n.\n.\n2.65V[3.5V]\n.\n.\n.\n0.65V[1.5V]\n.\n.\n0V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 259.842 142.494 0)
		(effects
