		(uuid "2f399bba-7121-42d5-b70a-5b23588f1342")
	)
	(text "Unit Resistors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.764 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4da3109b-fde1-40f0-984b-83e5278a3430")
	)
	(text "For amplifier we have:\nV_ADC = (VOUTP - VOUTN) + VREF\n\nIf VOUTP - VOUTN = -1V → V_ADC = VREF - 1V\nIf VOUTP - VOUTN = +1V → V_ADC = VREF + 1V\n\nVREF - 1V ≥ 0V   → VREF ≥ 1.0V\nVREF + 1V ≤ 3.3V → VREF ≤ 2.3V\nVREF_chosen = (1.0V + 2.3V) / 2 = 1.65V\nResult: Swings from 0.65V to 2.65V\n\nSame for 5V if VREF is maintained equal to VMID=VDD/2:\nVREF - 1V ≥ 0V   → VREF ≥ 1.0V\nVREF + 1V ≤ 5.0V → VREF ≤ 4.0V\nVREF_chosen = (1.0V + 4.0V) / 2 = 2.5V\nResult: Swings from 1.5V to 3.5V\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 189.992 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ae3c77cd-f307-41d1-8a92-5dca04552aee")
	)
	(text "From datasheet we are given:\nVISO = 1.23V * ((R1 + R2) / R1)\nwhere R1 is between VSEL & GND \nand R2 and between VSEL & VISO\n\nFor VISO=5V we set R1 = 10k\nR2 = ((5.0V / 1.23V) * 10k ) - 10k\nR2 = 30650.4065041 ~= 30.9k (standard)\n\nFor VISO=3.3V we set R1 = 10k\nR2 = ((3.3V / 1.23V) * 10k ) - 10k\nR2 = 16829.2682927 ~= 16.9k (standard)\n\n\nWe will set R2=16.9k for VISO = 3V3, as 5V-->3V3  is invalid (see \ntruth table 16 in datasheet) and we wish to support VDD = 5v or 3V3 \n\nThis means only B-variation will be supported:\n\nAMC Version	|	VDD1 Range	|	VDD2 Range\n----------------------------------\nAMC1311		|	4.5-5.5 V	|	3.0-5.5 V\nAMC1311B	|	3.0-5.5 V	|	3.0-5.5 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.962 29.972 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cb1e8588-a6de-4414-95d3-e4e40569aaae")
	)
	(text "Translates into unity full scale differential voltage Vdiff=2V(max)\ncentered at VCMout (min 1.39, typ 1.44, max 1.49)\nThus typical expected is OUTP = 1.44V + Vdiff / 2 \nand OUTN = 1.44V - Vdiff / 2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 188.468 81.026 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f9d0e0b5-5469-4b18-b8e7-2696f2b64f4c")
	)
	(text "V_OUTP(max)\n.\n.\n.\nV_CMout\n.\n.\n.\nV_OUTN(min)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.342 90.424 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
				(color 72 72 72 1)
			)
			(justify right)
		)
		(uuid "fd5fd196-9c6d-4637-8e1f-2c73f518515d")
	)
	(text "Note: Arc or sinusoidal waveform indicates \nvarying DC (due to load or ripple), NOT AC. \nAMC1311 outputs a differential analog signal \nrepresenting isolated, scaled DC input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 64.516 72.136 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fdc47633-924e-4069-a1b0-799a8444bd07")
	)
